## Prerequisites

- **Node.js** >= 18
- **PostgreSQL** >= 14 (or Neon serverless)
- **npm** >= 9

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Configure environment
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env: set DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET

# Push schema to database
npm run db:push

# Start development (hot reload)
npm run dev
```

Open **http://localhost:3000** — Swagger docs at **http://localhost:3000/docs**.

