## Available Scripts

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `npm run dev` | Start dev server with `tsx watch` (auto-restart on change) |
| `npm run build` | Generate Prisma client + compile TypeScript to `dist/` |
| `npm start` | Build & run production server from `dist/server.js` |
| `npm run lint` | Run ESLint on `src/` |
| `npm run typecheck` | Type-check with `tsc --noEmit` (no output files) |
