## Environment Variables

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `NODE_ENV` | `development` | Environment mode (`development` / `production`) |
| `PORT` | `3000` | HTTP server port |
| `DATABASE_URL` | *(required)* | PostgreSQL connection string |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | `info` | Pino log level: `trace`, `debug`, `info`, `warn`, `error`, `fatal` |
| `BODY_SIZE_LIMIT` | `1mb` | Max JSON body size (Express `express.json()`) |
| `REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS` | `30000` | Request timeout in milliseconds |
| `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` | `""` | Comma-separated allowed origins (empty = same-origin only) |
| `RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS` | `60000` | Rate limit window in ms |
| `RATE_LIMIT_MAX` | `100` | Max requests per window |
| `REDIS_URL` | `""` | Redis URL (for distributed rate limiting) |

### Auth (JWT Plugin)

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `JWT_SECRET` | *(required)* | Access token secret (min 32 chars, use `backgen rotate-secrets`) |
| `JWT_REFRESH_SECRET` | *(required)* | Refresh token secret (min 32 chars) |
| `JWT_EXPIRES_IN` | `15m` | Access token TTL |
| `JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN` | `7d` | Refresh token TTL (max 90d for compliance) |

