## API Endpoints

### Auth (`/api/auth`)

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | No | Create account (email, password) |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | No | Sign in, returns access + refresh tokens |
| POST | `/api/auth/logout` | No | Revoke refresh token (body: `{ refreshToken }`) |
| POST | `/api/auth/refresh` | No | Rotate refresh token, get new pair |
| POST | `/api/auth/change-password` | Bearer | Change password, invalidates all sessions |

**Auth header format:** `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>`

{{#if enableRbac}}
### RBAC

Roles: `USER` (default), `ADMIN`

- Admin routes require `x-user-role: ADMIN` header + valid token
- Middleware: `requireRole("ADMIN")` in route definitions

{{/if}}
