## Security

- **Helmet** — HTTP security headers
- **CORS whitelist** — origin enforcement via `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS`
- **Rate limiting** — per-IP (100 req/min default)
- **Input validation** — Zod schemas on all endpoints
- **XSS + NoSQL injection** — request body sanitization
- **Prototype pollution** — `__proto__`, `constructor`, `prototype` blocked
- **JWT algorithm pinning** — `HS256` only (no algorithm confusion)
- **Password hashing** — bcryptjs (no native deps, no CVEs)
- **Refresh token rotation** — old token invalidated on refresh
- **Session invalidation** — `tokenVersion` bump on password change

